Propellerhead Remote Mapping File
File Format Version	1.0.0
Control Surface Manufacturer	Akai
Control Surface Model	MPK Mini Play
Map Version	1.0.0


//======================================================================
//  Redrum Drum Computer
//
//  Pads 1-10  -> Select Drum 1-10      (Bank A + B)
//  Pads 11-14 -> Pattern 1-4           (Bank B)
//  Pads 15-16 -> Shuffle / Edit Accent (Bank B)
//  Knobs 1-4A -> Drum 1-4 Level        (CC21-24)
//  Knobs 1-4B -> Drum 1-4 Pan          (CC25-28)
//  Joystick X -> (no pitch bend on Redrum; retargetable via override)
//  Joystick Y -> (no mod wheel on Redrum; retargetable via override)
//  Keyboard   -> Keyboard
//======================================================================

Scope	Propellerheads	Redrum Drum Computer
// Define Group	Keyboard Shortcut Variations	Level	Pan	Velocity	Length
//	Control Surface Item	Key	Remotable Item	Scale	Mode

Map	_Scope		"Redrum"
Map	Keyboard		Keyboard

// --- Pads: drum select (Bank A) ----------------------
Map	Pad 1		Select Drum 1
Map	Pad 2		Select Drum 2
Map	Pad 3		Select Drum 3
Map	Pad 4		Select Drum 4
Map	Pad 5		Select Drum 5
Map	Pad 6		Select Drum 6
Map	Pad 7		Select Drum 7
Map	Pad 8		Select Drum 8

// --- Pads: drum select + transport (Bank B) ----------
Map	Pad 9		Select Drum 9
Map	Pad 10		Select Drum 10
Map	Pad 11		Pattern 1
Map	Pad 12		Pattern 2
Map	Pad 13		Pattern 3
Map	Pad 14		Pattern 4
Map	Pad 15		Shuffle
Map	Pad 16		Edit Accent

// --- Knob Bank A (CC21-24): channel levels -----------
Map	Knob 1 A		Drum 1 Level
Map	Knob 2 A		Drum 2 Level
Map	Knob 3 A		Drum 3 Level
Map	Knob 4 A		Drum 4 Level

// --- Knob Bank B (CC25-28): channel pans -------------
Map	Knob 1 B		Drum 1 Pan
Map	Knob 2 B		Drum 2 Pan
Map	Knob 3 B		Drum 3 Pan
Map	Knob 4 B		Drum 4 Pan

// --- Joystick / wheels -------------------------------
// Redrum exposes neither pitch bend nor mod wheel. The lines below are
// deliberately left commented; use Remote Overrides to re-point them.
//Map	Joystick X		Pitch Bend
//Map	Joystick Y		Mod Wheel